{'symbol': 'PTC', 'date': '2022-05-24 17:00:00', 'title': 'PTC EXPANDS ROLES FOR EXECUTIVE TEAM MEMBERS', 'text': "COMPANY NAMES MIKE DITULLIO TO PRESIDENT, DIGITAL THREAD GROUP; CATHERINE KNIKER TO CHIEF STRATEGY AND SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER BOSTON , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PTC\xa0(NASDAQ: PTC) TODAY ANNOUNCED EXPANDED ROLES FOR TWO MEMBERS OF ITS EXECUTIVE TEAM, BOTH EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. LONG-TIME PTC EXECUTIVE AND CURRENT PRESIDENT OF PTC'S VELOCITY GROUP MIKE DITULLIO WILL TAKE OVER AS PRESIDENT OF THE COMPANY'S LARGER DIGITAL THREAD GROUP."}